#: man-labplot.1.docbook:9
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "LabPlot User's Manual"
msgstr "LabPlot उपयोक्तृपुस्तिका"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:10
#. Tag: author
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<firstname>Helen</firstname><surname>Faulkner</surname> <contrib>LabPlot "
"man page.</contrib> <email>helen_ml_faulkner@yahoo.co.uk</email>"
msgstr ""
"<firstname>हेलेन</firstname><surname>Faulkner</surname> <contrib>LabPlot "
"man page.</contrib> <email>helen_ml_faulkner@yahoo.co.uk</email>"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:13
#. Tag: date
#, no-c-format
msgid "2018-09-28"
msgstr "२०१८-०९-२८"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:14
#. Tag: releaseinfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "LabPlot 2.6"
msgstr "लैबप्लॉट् २.६"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:15
#. Tag: productname
#, no-c-format
msgid "LabPlot"
msgstr "लैबप्लॉट"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:20
#. Tag: manvolnum
#, no-c-format
msgid "<manvolnum>1</manvolnum>"
msgstr "<मन्वोल्नुम्>१</मन्वोल्नुम्>"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:24
#. Tag: refname
#, no-c-format
msgid "<refname>labplot</refname>"
msgstr "<refname>लबप्लॉट्</refname> इति"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:25
#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"an application by KDE for interactive graphing and analysis of scientific "
"data."
msgstr ""
"वैज्ञानिकदत्तांशस्य अन्तरक्रियाशीलग्राफिंग् तथा विश्लेषणार्थं KDE द्वारा "
"एकः अनुप्रयोगः।"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:29
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>labplot</command> <arg choice=\"opt\"><replaceable>LabPlot "
"options</replaceable></arg> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><replaceable>file</replaceable></arg>"
msgstr ""
"<command>labplot</command> <arg choice=\"opt\"><replaceable>LabPlot "
"विकल्पाः</replaceable></arg> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><replaceable>सञ्चिका</replaceable></arg>"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:37
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:38
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "LabPlot is a data plotting and analysis tool."
msgstr "LabPlot इति आँकडा-प्लॉटिङ्ग्-विश्लेषण-उपकरणम् अस्ति ।"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:41
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Its features include 2D and 3D data and function plotting, easy editing of "
"plots, analysis of data and functions, support for different worksheets "
"using MDI and LabPlot project files."
msgstr ""
"अस्य विशेषतासु 2D तथा 3D डाटा तथा फंक्शन् प्लॉटिङ्ग्, प्लॉट् इत्यस्य सुलभं "
"सम्पादनं, डाटा तथा फंक्शन्स् इत्यस्य विश्लेषणं, MDI तथा LabPlot परियोजना "
"सञ्चिकानां उपयोगेन भिन्नकार्यपत्राणां समर्थनं च अन्तर्भवति"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:44
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note that LabPlot is called using <command>labplot</command>."
msgstr ""
"ध्यानं कुर्वन्तु यत् LabPlot <command>labplot</command> इत्यस्य उपयोगेन "
"आह्वयति ।"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:50
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "LabPlot options"
msgstr "LabPlot विकल्पाः"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:51
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a full summary of generic options, run "
"<userinput><command>labplot</command> "
"<parameter>--help</parameter></userinput>."
msgstr ""
"सामान्यविकल्पानां पूर्णसारांशाय <userinput><command>labplot</command> "
"<parameter>--help</parameter></userinput> चालयन्तु ।"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:57
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--no-splash"
msgstr "--न-स्प्लैश"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:59
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not show the splash screen."
msgstr "स्प्लैश स्क्रीन् न दर्शयन्तु।"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:64
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--presenter"
msgstr "--प्रस्तोता"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:66
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start in the presenter mode."
msgstr "प्रस्तोता मोड् मध्ये आरभत ।"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:72
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr "तर्काः"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:75
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "file"
msgstr "संचिका"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:77
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The location of the project to be opened, usually ending with <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.lml</literal>."
msgstr ""
"उद्घाटनीयस्य परियोजनायाः स्थानं, प्रायः <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.lml</literal> इत्यनेन समाप्तं भवति ।"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:78
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The project file can be also compressed, with its filename ending with "
"<literal role=\"extension\">.lml.gz</literal>, <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.lml.bz2</literal> or <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.lml.xz</literal>."
msgstr ""
"परियोजनासञ्चिका अपि संपीडयितुं शक्यते, तस्याः सञ्चिकानाम <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.lml.gz</literal>, <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.lml.bz2</literal> अथवा <literal role इत्यनेन समाप्तं "
"भवति =\"विस्तार\">.lml.xz</literal>."

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:85
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "See Also"
msgstr "इदमपि पश्यन्तु"

#: man-labplot.1.docbook:87
#. Tag: member
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Full user documentation is available through the KDE Help Centre. You can "
"also enter the URL <ulink url=\"help:/labplot\">help:/labplot</ulink> "
"(either enter this <acronym>URL</acronym> into &dolphin;, or run "
"<userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/labplot</parameter></userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"KDE सहायताकेन्द्रस्य माध्यमेन पूर्णं उपयोक्तृदस्तावेजं उपलभ्यते । भवान् "
"<ulink url=\"help:/labplot\">help:/labplot</ulink> इति URL अपि प्रविष्टुं "
"शक्नोति (एतत् <acronym>URL</acronym> इत्येतत् &dolphin; मध्ये प्रविशतु, "
"अथवा <userinput><command>khelpcenter चालयितुं शक्नोति </command> "
"<parameter>सहाय्यम्:/labplot</parameter></userinput>)।"

